0..75 Comment "// A manifest sort: `Model(T) with sort x = A` is the type of the models of"
76..151 Comment "// `T` whose sort `x` is `A`, as `module-signature-matching.gandr`\'s record"
152..229 Comment "// signature states `type Ratio = Integer`. The model type gives the sort, so"
230..301 Comment "// a model need not, and a sealed model keeps it: what reads the sealed"
302..355 Comment "// model\'s constant at `Ratio` reads it at `Integer`."
357..419 Comment "/// Metrics, the theory of `module-signature-matching.gandr`\'s"
